values('project-environment-01','project-environment',2,'1.6','Before selecting a booking-system supplier, the manager reviews population changes, legislation and technology trends. What is the main purpose of this PESTLE analysis?','[{"id":"a","text":"Assign every work package to a team member."},{"id":"b","text":"Identify external influences that may change project decisions."},{"id":"c","text":"Approve the supplier contract without further review."},{"id":"d","text":"Prove that all delivery risks have been eliminated."}]'::jsonb,'b','PESTLE examines the external context so assumptions, options and risks can be reconsidered. Work assignment belongs in delivery planning; supplier approval needs the agreed authority and evidence. An environmental scan cannot eliminate uncertainty.')
