values('project-environment-02','project-environment',2,'1.2','Which activity is most clearly business as usual after a digital ticketing project has closed?','[{"id":"a","text":"Designing the first ticketing workflow."},{"id":"b","text":"Installing the new entry scanners."},{"id":"c","text":"Managing the one-off transition to the new service."},{"id":"d","text":"Handling routine ticket queries each day."}]'::jsonb,'d','Routine service operation is ongoing work. Designing, installing and transitioning a new service are temporary change activities. Using the project output does not make every later operational activity part of that project.')
