values('project-environment-04','project-environment',2,'1.1','Which feature most clearly makes replacing a museum’s admission system a project?','[{"id":"a","text":"It has a defined change to deliver through a temporary effort."},{"id":"b","text":"It must continue unchanged for the life of the museum."},{"id":"c","text":"It consists only of the daily ticket-selling operation."},{"id":"d","text":"It has no identifiable objective or endpoint."}]'::jsonb,'a','A project is a temporary effort directed at a particular change. The resulting service may continue for years, but operating it is different from creating it. An indefinite routine without a defined change is not the distinguishing feature.')
