values('project-environment-05','project-environment',2,'1.6','A PESTLE workshop identifies a technology that may soon make the preferred system obsolete. What is the most useful follow-up?','[{"id":"a","text":"File the heading and assume the scan has removed the risk."},{"id":"b","text":"Automatically stop every activity without assessing the impact."},{"id":"c","text":"Ignore the finding because the team cannot control external technology."},{"id":"d","text":"Investigate the evidence, assign a follow-up owner and reconsider options or assumptions."}]'::jsonb,'d','The scan should inform action and decisions. A factor can matter even when the team cannot control its cause. Neither filing it nor automatically stopping the project is a proportionate substitute for assessing its effect.')
