values('project-roles-01','project-roles',2,'3.1','Who remains accountable for the investment justification and continuing business case?','[{"id":"a","text":"Every supplier equally."},{"id":"b","text":"The project sponsor."},{"id":"c","text":"The project management office by default."},{"id":"d","text":"The end-user testing group."}]'::jsonb,'b','The sponsor owns the investment justification. The manager and specialists provide delivery evidence, a PMO may support reporting or assurance, and users contribute needs and acceptance evidence; those contributions do not automatically transfer sponsorship.')
