values('project-roles-05','project-roles',2,'3.1','Why should end users be involved in defining needs and testing an output?','[{"id":"a","text":"They must personally authorise all project expenditure."},{"id":"b","text":"Their involvement removes the sponsor’s accountability."},{"id":"c","text":"They can guarantee there will be no operational change."},{"id":"d","text":"They provide evidence about practical use and whether the output meets real needs."}]'::jsonb,'d','Users contribute operational knowledge and acceptance evidence. That does not automatically give them every spending authority, transfer sponsorship or remove the work of adoption.')
