values('project-life-cycles-01','project-life-cycles',2,'2.3','A project uses sequential construction approvals but develops its booking interface through repeated user-feedback cycles. Which life-cycle description fits best?','[{"id":"a","text":"Hybrid."},{"id":"b","text":"Only business as usual."},{"id":"c","text":"Linear with no iterative element."},{"id":"d","text":"An extended life cycle solely because there are two suppliers."}]'::jsonb,'a','Combining linear and iterative elements is a hybrid approach. Supplier count does not define an extended life cycle, which concerns the wider period of outcomes and benefits. The example describes temporary change, not only routine operations.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
