values('risk-and-issue-management-01','risk-and-issue-management',2,'7.7','A component has already arrived damaged and needs a decision about replacement. How should this situation primarily be handled?','[{"id":"a","text":"As a current issue requiring assessment, ownership and resolution."},{"id":"b","text":"Only as a future uncertain event with no present action."},{"id":"c","text":"As proof that the project has no remaining risks."},{"id":"d","text":"As an automatically approved scope reduction."}]'::jsonb,'a','The damage is a current problem, so issue management is needed. It may create further risks or change requests, but it should not remain only a hypothetical risk or trigger an unauthorised scope decision.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('risk-and-issue-management-02','risk-and-issue-management',2,'7.4','Which risk-register entry is most useful for management?','[{"id":"a","text":"A red square with no description."},{"id":"b","text":"An unnamed concern copied from another project."},{"id":"c","text":"A problem title with no review date or action."},{"id":"d","text":"A cause/event/effect description with assessment, owner, response and review status."}]'::jsonb,'d','The register should support decisions and follow-up. A colour, copied concern or bare title does not explain exposure or who will act. The detail should remain proportionate to the risk.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('risk-and-issue-management-03','risk-and-issue-management',2,'7.1','Which statement correctly describes a project risk?','[{"id":"a","text":"It must be a problem that has already occurred."},{"id":"b","text":"It concerns uncertainty that could affect objectives, positively or negatively."},{"id":"c","text":"It is always a supplier invoice."},{"id":"d","text":"It can only exist after handover."}]'::jsonb,'b','Risk includes uncertain threats and opportunities. A current problem is an issue, and invoices or handover dates are not defining characteristics of risk.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('risk-and-issue-management-04','risk-and-issue-management',2,'7.3','After identifying and analysing a significant threat, what is an appropriate next step?','[{"id":"a","text":"Agree a proportionate response, an owner and arrangements to monitor the remaining exposure."},{"id":"b","text":"Close the entry automatically because it has been analysed."},{"id":"c","text":"Keep only the risk title and remove ownership."},{"id":"d","text":"Assume that every threat must be transferred to a supplier."}]'::jsonb,'a','Analysis should lead to a response decision and follow-up. Exposure can remain after action, so monitoring and eventual justified closure matter. No single response is appropriate for every threat.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('risk-and-issue-management-05','risk-and-issue-management',2,'7.8','A current issue has an owner and an agreed solution. When should it normally be closed?','[{"id":"a","text":"As soon as the issue is first described."},{"id":"b","text":"Immediately after someone proposes an untested idea."},{"id":"c","text":"Whenever the reporting colour needs to improve."},{"id":"d","text":"After the response is implemented and resolution and remaining effects are checked."}]'::jsonb,'d','Closure should be supported by evidence that the issue has been resolved and relevant consequences addressed. A proposal, a description or a cosmetic status change is not enough.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
