values('quality-management-01','quality-management',2,'8.4','Measuring a delivered bench against its agreed dimensions is primarily which activity?','[{"id":"a","text":"Portfolio selection."},{"id":"b","text":"Benefits identification."},{"id":"c","text":"Quality control."},{"id":"d","text":"Stakeholder classification."}]'::jsonb,'c','Quality control checks an output against requirements. Portfolio choices, benefit identification and stakeholder analysis answer different questions; they do not replace output inspection.')
