values('quality-management-02','quality-management',2,'8.5','Reviewing whether suitable inspection procedures exist and are being followed primarily provides what?','[{"id":"a","text":"Quality assurance."},{"id":"b","text":"Automatic approval of every change."},{"id":"c","text":"Proof that all later benefits have occurred."},{"id":"d","text":"A replacement for every output test."}]'::jsonb,'a','Assurance builds confidence in the processes and controls used. It does not automatically authorise changes, prove realised benefits or remove the need to check outputs.')
