values('quality-management-03','quality-management',2,'8.6','Which review is best suited to checking whether the expected queue-time improvement actually occurred after adoption?','[{"id":"a","text":"A drawing version check alone."},{"id":"b","text":"A procurement competition."},{"id":"c","text":"A daily task allocation meeting."},{"id":"d","text":"A benefit review."}]'::jsonb,'d','A benefit review examines realised improvement in use. Version checks, supplier selection and daily coordination can support delivery but do not establish whether that benefit occurred.')
