values('quality-management-04','quality-management',2,'8.1','A costly display case fails an agreed accessibility requirement. Which conclusion best reflects project quality?','[{"id":"a","text":"High cost automatically proves high quality."},{"id":"b","text":"The output does not fulfil an agreed requirement, despite its cost."},{"id":"c","text":"Quality concerns only visual appearance."},{"id":"d","text":"The acceptance requirement should be deleted without an authorised decision."}]'::jsonb,'b','Quality concerns fulfilment of requirements. Price and appearance may be relevant considerations, but they do not override an agreed requirement or authorise changing acceptance criteria.')
