values('quality-management-05','quality-management',2,'8.3','Which activity belongs primarily to quality planning?','[{"id":"a","text":"Re-labelling a failed test result as successful."},{"id":"b","text":"Waiting until handover before asking users what is acceptable."},{"id":"c","text":"Agreeing requirements, acceptance criteria, responsibilities and how evidence will be obtained."},{"id":"d","text":"Assuming an independent audit can replace all acceptance tests."}]'::jsonb,'c','Planning defines how the required quality will be achieved and demonstrated. It should influence work early. Neither changing labels nor postponing criteria provides credible evidence of fulfilment.')
