values('scope-management-04','scope-management',2,'5.7','A stakeholder requests an additional display case after the scope baseline is agreed. What should happen before implementation?','[{"id":"a","text":"Record the request, assess impacts and obtain the authorised decision."},{"id":"b","text":"Implement it first because any requested addition must be beneficial."},{"id":"c","text":"Approve it merely by changing the drawing filename."},{"id":"d","text":"Delete the original baseline so there is no variance."}]'::jsonb,'a','Change control evaluates the request against agreed objectives and constraints before the appropriate authority decides. A filename change is not approval, and removing the reference conceals the effect rather than managing it.')
