values('scope-management-05','scope-management',2,'5.8','Which set describes typical configuration management activities?','[{"id":"a","text":"Supplier selection, invoicing and recruitment only."},{"id":"b","text":"Unrecorded changes followed by deletion of every earlier record."},{"id":"c","text":"Taking user feedback without identifying any controlled item."},{"id":"d","text":"Planning, identification, control, status accounting and verification/audit."}]'::jsonb,'d','Configuration management maintains reliable identities, versions, approved characteristics and status. Its activities support traceability and checking that the correct approved configuration is being used.')
