values('estimating-02','estimating',2,'4.9','What does the estimating funnel illustrate?','[{"id":"a","text":"Every estimate must become a fixed price immediately."},{"id":"b","text":"The uncertainty range generally narrows as information and understanding improve."},{"id":"c","text":"Exact decimal places eliminate uncertainty."},{"id":"d","text":"Early estimates always use more detail than later estimates."}]'::jsonb,'b','The funnel represents improving confidence as evidence develops. It does not guarantee accuracy or justify false precision. An early estimate normally has less supporting detail and needs its assumptions and range explained.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('estimating-03','estimating',2,'4.8','A manager adjusts the total cost of a comparable completed project to estimate a new one. Which method is being used?','[{"id":"a","text":"Critical path analysis."},{"id":"b","text":"Configuration accounting."},{"id":"c","text":"Analogous estimating."},{"id":"d","text":"Quality control."}]'::jsonb,'c','Analogous estimating draws on comparable previous work and adjusts for differences. The other activities concern scheduling, configuration records or output checks, rather than estimating from a comparable total.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
insert into apm_private.checkpoint_questions as current (id,lesson_id,content_version,syllabus_ref,stem,choices,correct_option_id,explanation)
values('estimating-04','estimating',2,'4.8','The team estimates survey, installation, testing and handover work packages, then combines those estimates. Which method is this?','[{"id":"a","text":"Analogous estimating from one previous project total."},{"id":"b","text":"Analytical estimating from the component work."},{"id":"c","text":"A project audit."},{"id":"d","text":"Resource smoothing."}]'::jsonb,'b','Analytical estimating builds from a breakdown of the work. It still needs care over inclusions, shared work and double-counting. Audits and resource optimisation have different purposes.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
