values('estimating-05','estimating',2,'4.9','An early estimate is presented as £10,000.00 even though important access conditions are unknown. What is the main concern?','[{"id":"a","text":"An estimate can never contain a currency amount."},{"id":"b","text":"More decimal places guarantee a narrower uncertainty range."},{"id":"c","text":"The apparent precision may conceal weak information and untested assumptions."},{"id":"d","text":"The estimate must automatically equal the final authorised budget."}]'::jsonb,'c','Precision of presentation is different from confidence in the forecast. Explain assumptions and a reasonable range. Better evidence, rather than extra decimal places, supports a narrower estimating funnel.')
